  "originalQuery": "A Database Engineer is responsible for designing a backup and recovery solution for a heterogeneous environment that includes databases running on Google Cloud SQL, Google Cloud Firestore, and Google Cloud Spanner. The solution must ensure low Recovery Point Objective (RPO) and Recovery Time Objective (RTO) while meeting the unique backup requirements of each database system. Which of the following backup and recovery solutions best meets these requirements?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Deploying a third-party backup and recovery solution that supports all three database systems.<br/>B. Relying solely on the built-in redundancy and replication features of each database system.<br/>C. Utilizing database-specific backup solutions: scheduled automated backups for Cloud SQL, export/import operations for Firestore, and regional replication for Cloud Spanner.<br/>D. Creating a custom backup solution that exports data from each database system to a Cloud Storage bucket on a daily basis.",
